      "created_at": "2012-09-12T01:47:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Looking for clarification or generally accepted interpretation of Nightmists' Oblivion spell. It says to draw two cards and choose one to do damage to each target and the other to do damage to each non- hero target. &nbsp; The way I read this, for one card everybody - heroes and Villians - take damage and then for the other card only Villians take damage.&nbsp;</p><p>Does anybody have a different take or a rules clarification?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
