      "raw": "<p>As a piece of generosity to my poor deprived fellow forumites, the rules text for Oblivion is as follows:</p><blockquote><p>Reveal the top 2 cards of your deck. Nightmist deals each target one of the revealed card&#39;s [spell point] infernal damage, then deals each non-hero target the other revealed card&#39;s [spell point] infernal damage. Put the revealed cards into your trash.</p></blockquote><p>So no, you can&#39;t choose the order. You have to damage yourself and the other heroes before you burn the villains.</p>",
